  m_text: "<b>Approach and Capture</b>\r\n\r\n- To begin the boarding procedure,
    arrive within 20 km of the enemy ship. Refer to the target data display for range
    information.\r\n- When a turn ends with your ship within boarding range, the
    boarding button will light up. Boarding pods will be sent to the target ship.\r\n\r-
    Your marines are limited, so avoid wasting them.\r\n"
